          <li><a href="https://sharp.pixelplumbing.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Sharp</a> — Apache License 2.0.</li>
          <li><a href="https://www.typescriptlang.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">TypeScript</a>, Microsoft Corporation — Apache License 2.0.</li>
